 dead, right?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXAMINE</strong>: Analyze their condition<i> (click and hold)</i>;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEAL</strong>: hold the illness in the body\u00a0<i>(click and drag side to side)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLUG</strong>: plug\u00a0natural cavities \u00a0<i>(multi-click)</i>;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BAG</strong>: Then, bag them<i> (click and drag down)</i> and return to the truck.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*conditions may vary</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/23e25ab6f69177f4a13640777f5b8e92.poster.avif?t=1755024112\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/23e25ab6f69177f4a13640777f5b8e92.webm?t=1755024112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/23e25ab6f69177f4a13640777f5b8e92.mp4?t=1755024112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you're done, another dead awaits.\u00a0\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Collect your payment</strong> at the Medical Center before the day's end;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>upkeep</strong> is due, and the Taxman is more unavoidable than the\u00a0illness.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/599944db3160a738757fe06d6f1d8cc4.poster.avif?t=1755024112\" width