pps/3859230/extras/638a63506b1276dc1d91b48d9ad9fbf3.webm?t=1755024112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/638a63506b1276dc1d91b48d9ad9fbf3.mp4?t=1755024112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>mad cultists to corrupt officials, down-on-their-luck civilians to rebellious artistic anarchists</strong>,  each will see you through the filter of their plans and creeds.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/e8e37a45297e39e97fa8135fbd4b70d6.poster.avif?t=1755024112\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/e8e37a45297e39e97fa8135fbd4b70d6.webm?t=1755024112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/e8e37a45297e39e97fa8135fbd4b70d6.mp4?t=1755024112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your CHOICES &amp; JOURNEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city and its inhabitants will remember your actions, so choose carefully how you'll deal with favors and threats, friend and foe. Carve your way towards multiple endings where you are the driving force of unforgettable consequences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your choices heal the world, make it better?<br>Or will you stoke the sickly flames of the end, breaking it beyond all repair?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city echoes through half-empty streets...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who are you, Crow?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/1fb4e7131c7acd990c3150f3291d6598.poster.avif?t=1755024112\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/1fb4e7131c7acd990c3150f3291d6598.webm?t=1755024112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/1fb4e7131c7acd990c3150f3291d6598.mp4?t=1755024112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
